<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Zeigler Coal cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Zeigler Coal cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said analyst Marc Cohen downgraded Zeigler Coal Holding Co to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- PaineWebber made the intra-day rating change on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Zeigler Coal lost 1-3/8 to 25-7/8.</p>
</text>
